        <p>Our movement science team evaluate a patient's physical condition and identify specific impairments,
          functional
          limitations, and disabilities. The assessment aims to develop a comprehensive understanding of the patient's
          health status and to inform the development of an individualized treatment plan. Key components of our
          physiotherapy assessment include:
          <br>1.Subjective Examination: Gathering detailed information from the patient about their medical history,
          symptoms, lifestyle, and goals. This includes discussing the onset, nature, and duration of the problem, as
          well
          as any previous treatments or interventions. <br>
          2.Objective Examination: Conducting physical tests and observations to assess the patient's physical abilities
